   ("p", "A stopwatch seems like the simplest tool in the world, press start, press stop, but the moment you need to time more than one thing at once, two words start to matter: lap and split. Getting them straight is the difference between useful timing data and a single number you cannot do much with. This guide explains what lap and split times mean, when each is the one you want, and how to time real activities accurately with the free <a href=\"../tools/online-stopwatch.html\">Online Stopwatch</a>."),
